        "desc": "毕竟在这世界上，没有一个人能活着得到解脱。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/08/326985891/50f4c72d3aba1c55738e456eee94f440_827648800428315832.png",
